{
  "$comment": "Risk of an MCP tool from its name (SPEC §4.3). (1) Split the name into lower-case words at '_', '-', '.', spaces and camelCase boundaries ('listIssues' -> list, issues; 'HTTPGet' -> http, get). (2) Base risk: the FIRST word that appears in any list decides; for that word the lists are checked in 'order', so a word in two lists takes the earlier one. No listed word -> 'execute'. (3) If the base risk is 'read' or 'write' and ANY word is in verbs.admin, the risk is 'admin' (get_secret, list_permissions).",
